  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It looks like a bedbug: flat and wide, with a small head and an oval green body that emits a faint jade coloured glow.",
        "chapters": [
          79
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In the aperture it shows a green jade color.",
        "chapters": [
          99
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan’s inheritance copy looks like a flat, wide bedbug with a small head and an oval green body that gives off a faint jade glow. The text calls it one of the best defensive rank one Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          79
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo compares it to Bronze Skin Gu as stronger defense for less primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_bronze_skin_gu"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Activating it wraps the user in a sturdy jade-coloured skin or barrier.",
        "chapters": [
          76
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The defense is continuous: it needs a running supply of primeval essence, and harder hits spend more essence.",
        "chapters": [
          100
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan also uses it to cushion a hard fall from the canopy and lands with only back pain.",
        "chapters": [
          95
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After an intense battle in which he uses Jade Skin Gu multiple times, Fang Yuan’s rank one peak stage black green essence falls from a full 44% aperture fill to 36%, so about 8% spent in that stretch. The text equates that 8% black green spend to 64% of rank one initial stage jade green essence, and notes that an initial-stage aperture at 44% fill would run dry halfway through the same use. No cited chapter states a separate continuous-defense rate card for Jade Skin alone at rank one initial stage beyond that converted battle spend.",
        "chapters": [
          80
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against jade eye stone monkeys, the barrier holds about sixteen monkeys attacking at once before it is outclassed by White Jade Gu’s later rating.",
        "chapters": [
          100
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_white_jade_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "In the academy arena, Fang Yuan breaks Fang Zheng’s Jade Skin barrier with bare fists, which shocks the watchers because the defense is supposed to stop moonblades and ordinary blows.",
        "chapters": [
          85
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It eats jade rock: two pieces every ten days, restated as two liang of jade rocks every ten days.",
        "chapters": [
          79
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Zheng gets jade rocks from the clan leader, so Fang Yuan worries that buying rock would easily expose him; he instead plans to feed it from jade eye stone monkeys in the stone forest.",
        "chapters": [
          79
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He kills those monkeys every few days for that food.",
        "chapters": [
          80
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "refinement": {
    "recipes": [],
    "used_in_recipes": [],
    "refinement_materials": [],
    "confirmed_evolutions": [],
    "related_variants": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "With White Boar Gu it fuses into rank two White Jade Gu. That product keeps and strengthens Jade Skin defense and drops White Boar’s strength gain.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The clan instead teaches Fang Zheng to fuse Jade Skin Gu with Moonlight Gu toward Moon Raiment on a line that can climb to Moonlight Treasure King Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fusion-lines",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_moonlight_gu",
          "gu_moon_raiment",
          "gu_moonlight_treasure_king_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
