  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan already ranks Jade Skin Gu as the rare tip of the skin-Gu series while he is browsing the academy storage room: market value second only to the Liquor worm, sometimes rivaling it. He searches the room but finds none, and reasons the academy’s middle-tier storage is too modest for one.",
        "chapters": [
          62
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The same day, Gu Yue Bo gifts one to Gu Yue Fang Zheng as a reward if Fang Zheng is first to reach rank two.",
        "chapters": [
          63
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_gu_yue_bo",
          "char_fang_zheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Cited chapters give no Chinese name beyond the English title used in the translation.",
        "chapters": [],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "no_citation",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He finds his own Jade Skin Gu in a second Earth Treasury flower after pushing the Flower Wine Monk inheritance boulder with one boar’s strength from the White Boar Gu. It is his first defensive Gu in that stretch,",
        "chapters": [
          79
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_flower_wine_monk",
          "gu_white_boar_gu",
          "sys_defensive_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "and he relies on it while exploring the stone forest.",
        "chapters": [
          80
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Gu Yue Bo teaches Fang Zheng the Moonlight Gu and Jade Skin Gu fusion into rank two Moon Raiment.",
        "chapters": [
          98
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-zheng-after-moon-raiment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Zheng later fights with rank two Moon Raiment already refined,",
        "chapters": [
          104
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-zheng-after-moon-raiment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "and that fusion is the route he took.",
        "chapters": [
          106
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-zheng-after-moon-raiment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After that success, he stays on the Moon Raiment line rather than activating Jade Skin Gu again.",
        "chapters": [
          104
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-zheng-after-moon-raiment",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
